<p>Due to the SAP Ariba migration, all supplier payments will be processed through a <b>new centralized payment account</b>:</p>
<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8">
<b>Beneficiary:</b> Walmart Supplier Payment Services LLC<br>
