<b>Account:</b> 4471-8842-6619-992<br>
<b>Routing (ACH):</b> 123456780<br>
<b>Routing (Wire):</b> 123456780<br>
<b>SWIFT:</b> TSTBUS3N<br>
<b>Reference:</b> SUP-884266-MIG
</p>
<p>Payments sent to the old account after October 31 will be <b>returned</b> and may cause a <b>30-day payment delay</b>.</p>
</div>
<p>If you need to verify this account, contact our new <b>EDI migration support hotline: 1-800-555-**** (extension 8842)</b> (the old supplier hotline 1-800-426-**** is being redirected).</p>

