<h3>About Ariba Supplier Registration</h3>
<p>When you click the registration button, you will be taken to SAP Ariba's supplier onboarding portal. You will need to:</p>
<ol>
<li>Create an Ariba Network account (using your corporate email)</li>
<li>Enter your company details (DUNS, tax ID, banking information)</li>
<li>Upload your business license and W-9 or international tax forms</li>
<li>Accept Walmart's supplier terms</li>
</ol>

<p style="font-size:14px;background:#E3F2FD;padding:12px;border-radius:4px">
<b>About the registration link:</b> You may notice that the button link goes to a Walmart supplier domain rather than ariba.com directly. This is because Walmart uses a <b>branded supplier registration portal</b> that pre-fills your supplier information before redirecting to SAP Ariba. This eliminates the need to manually enter your DUNS number and product codes. The registration page will display both the Walmart logo and the SAP Ariba logo.
</p>

